{"seq":2,"slug":"local-cold-warehouse-turnover","title":"本地冷库周转与冷链尾程保温","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/cold-customs-lastmile/local-cold-warehouse-turnover","wordCount":2214,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"本地冷库周转与冷链尾程保温\">本地冷库周转与冷链尾程保温</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨境冷链的最后一公里不是&quot;把箱子送到门口&quot;，而是<strong>用有限的保温资源，把一个温度受控的货物在不插电的条件下送达</strong>。这里存在一个根本的物理约束：<strong>末端配送车辆和配送员都不可能携带主动制冷设备</strong>，所以尾程的温度保障只能靠<strong>保温容器 + 冷媒</strong>这套被动系统，而被动系统的有效时长是有限的、可计算的。</p>\n<p>因此尾程设计的核心问题是一个<strong>时间预算问题</strong>：从冷库出库到客户签收，中间有多少时间？这段时间的温升在可接受范围内吗？如果超出，就要么缩短时间（时效窗、路由优化），要么提高保温能力（更好的箱体、更多冷媒），要么降低初始温度（预冷过量）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[销地冷库] --&gt; B[拣货/打包]&#10;  B --&gt; C[预冷/加冷媒]&#10;  C --&gt; D[装车]&#10;  D --&gt; E[分拨站]&#10;  E --&gt; F[末端配送]&#10;  F --&gt; G{签收}&#10;  G --&gt;|在家| H[当面签收+测温度]&#10;  G --&gt;|不在家| I[保温箱暂存/驿站]&#10;  I --&gt; J[二次配送]&#10;  G --&gt;|失败| K[回收处理]\">graph TD\n  A[销地冷库] --&gt; B[拣货/打包]\n  B --&gt; C[预冷/加冷媒]\n  C --&gt; D[装车]\n  D --&gt; E[分拨站]\n  E --&gt; F[末端配送]\n  F --&gt; G{签收}\n  G --&gt;|在家| H[当面签收+测温度]\n  G --&gt;|不在家| I[保温箱暂存/驿站]\n  I --&gt; J[二次配送]\n  G --&gt;|失败| K[回收处理]</pre><h2 id=\"冷藏保温容器的选型\">冷藏保温容器的选型</h2><h3 id=\"三种保温原理\">三种保温原理</h3><p>末端保温容器按冷源分三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>冷源</th>\n<th>有效时长</th>\n<th>可重复使用</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冰袋/冰盒</td>\n<td>相变蓄冷（水/共晶盐）</td>\n<td>数小时–1 天</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>冷藏短途</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干冰</td>\n<td>升华吸热（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>78.5</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-78.5\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">78.5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>1–3 天</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>冷冻配送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>液氮</td>\n<td>蒸发吸热</td>\n<td>数天（航空箱可达约 100 小时）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>深冷、超长时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>干冰与液氮的时长数据有一个可引用的锚点：相变/消耗型冷却方案在航空集装箱中可维持约 100 小时，在铁路货车中约两周（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Refrigerated_container\">Wikipedia, Refrigerated container</a>）。末端配送用量远小于航空箱，因此实际有效时长通常在数小时到一两天。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保温箱性能不是标称值-要实测\">保温箱性能不是标称值，要实测</h3><p>厂商标称的&quot;保温 24 小时&quot;是在<strong>特定环境温度、特定装载量、特定开关次数</strong>下测得的。真实配送中环境温度、开门次数、装载率都会偏离。因此有两件事必须做：</p>\n<p><strong>按季节分别标定</strong>。夏季 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 环境与冬季 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 环境下的可用时长大不相同，用一个标称值排班会在夏季大面积超温。</p>\n<p><strong>按真实的配送时长分布设计</strong>。不是按平均值，而是按 P95 甚至 P99 的配送时长设计——超温事故恰恰发生在最慢的那些订单上。</p>\n<p>行业里有专门针对<strong>温控运输包装</strong>的测试方法可用于这项标定：ISTA 的 7 系列中，7D 是评估单个包装件受外部温度影响的发展性试验，7E 则是针对通过包裹配送网络运输的温控包装的测试标准，其温度曲线通过对该运输环境的刻画得出，代表全年冷热季节的极值（<a href=\"https://ista.org/test_procedures.php\">ISTA, Thermal Transport Packaging Tests</a>）。这意味着可以直接采用标准曲线做箱体选型与验收，而不是自己发明一套测试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间预算模型\">时间预算模型</h2><h3 id=\"温升是可计算的\">温升是可计算的</h3><p>被动保温系统在无主动制冷时的温升速率，近似取决于三个量：环境与箱内的温差、箱体的综合传热系数、以及冷媒的剩余蓄冷量。工程上更实用的做法是<strong>用实测标定的&quot;半衰期&quot;做一阶近似</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(t) = T_{env} - (T_{env} - T_0) e^{-kt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为箱内初始温度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{env}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为环境温度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为由箱体与冷媒共同决定的衰减常数（由实测标定）。据此可以反解出&quot;从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 升到报警阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{alarm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 需要多久&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{max} = -\\frac{1}{k}\\ln\\frac{T_{env} - T_{alarm}}{T_{env} - T_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子给出了一个极有用的运营量：<strong>可用配送时长</strong>。它可以按当前季节的环境温度、箱体型号、初始温度实时计算，并与实际路由的预计时长比较，超出的订单必须在打包环节加冷媒或改期。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def delivery_window_hours(k, t0, env, alarm):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;按一阶温升模型计算可用配送时长。&#10;    k: 实测衰减常数 (1/h); t0: 装箱初始温度; env: 预计环境温度; alarm: 报警阈值&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    import math&#10;    if not (t0 &lt; alarm &lt; env):&#10;        return float(&quot;inf&quot;)  # 环境低于阈值，无需担忧&#10;    if k &lt;= 0:&#10;        return 0.0&#10;    return -math.log((env - alarm) / (env - t0)) / k\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> delivery_window_hours</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k, t0, env, alarm):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"按一阶温升模型计算可用配送时长。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    k: 实测衰减常数 (1/h); t0: 装箱初始温度; env: 预计环境温度; alarm: 报警阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (t0 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alarm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 环境低于阈值，无需担忧</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">math.log((env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alarm) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t0)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"出库前的三个决策\">出库前的三个决策</h3><p>时间预算算出来之后，出库环节有三个可调旋钮：</p>\n<p><strong>初始温度</strong>。把货预冷到略低于目标设定点（如冷冻货预冷到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-20\\ ^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 再装箱），可以在同样的保温能力下多争取一段时间。代价是多消耗冷库制冷能耗，且部分品类不能过冷（冷藏品冻结会造成不可逆损伤，见 <a href=\"../coldchain-network-compliance/temperature-zone-category-fit\">温区与品类适配</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>冷媒用量</strong>。增加冰袋/干冰量能提高蓄冷总量、延缓温升，但会挤占装载空间、抬高成本与运费（干冰属于危险品，航空运输有额外限制）。</p>\n<p><strong>路由与时效窗</strong>。把&quot;可用配送时长&quot;作为路由与排班的硬约束，把时效窗开到不超过可用时长。这是成本最低的旋钮，但需要配送系统支持按时效窗分区排班。</p>\n<h2 id=\"末端配送的作业控制\">末端配送的作业控制</h2><h3 id=\"减少开门次数是最便宜的优化\">减少开门次数是最便宜的优化</h3><p>每次开箱都会让箱内暖空气与外界交换，冷量快速流失。三项控制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>合并配送</strong>：同一保温箱内多单合并，减少中途多次开箱取货；</li>\n<li><strong>按路线排序</strong>：把时效最紧的单排在前面，减少它暴露的时间；</li>\n<li><strong>整箱交付</strong>：尽可能整箱交给客户而非当面拆箱分件，交付动作更短。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"签收即验证\">签收即验证</h3><p>温控签收与普通签收的差别在于<strong>签收时要采集温度证据</strong>。&quot;签收&quot;这个动作本身要产生一个可追溯的温度读数。实现方式有两种：箱内记录仪（客户或配送员扫码读取），或箱体上的<strong>温度指示标签</strong>（一次性变色标签，超过阈值不可逆变色）。</p>\n<p>一次性温度标签的价值在于<strong>不可伪造且无需读数设备</strong>：配送员或客户凭肉眼即可判断，且变色不可逆，事后无法抵赖。它的局限是只有一个阈值、没有时间序列，因此常与记录仪并用——标签做现场判定，记录仪做后续定责。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;pod_temperature&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;consignment_id&quot;: &quot;LAX-2026-0925-4417&quot;,&#10;    &quot;delivered_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-25T18:32:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;box_model&quot;: &quot;insulated_b_24l&quot;,&#10;    &quot;coolant&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;phase_change_pack&quot;, &quot;count&quot;: 4 },&#10;    &quot;packed_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-25T09:05:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;initial_temp_c&quot;: 1.2,&#10;    &quot;temp_at_delivery_c&quot;: 4.1,&#10;    &quot;indicator_label&quot;: &quot;unchanged&quot;,&#10;    &quot;open_count&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;elapsed_h&quot;: 9.45&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pod_temperature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"consignment_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LAX-2026-0925-4417\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"delivered_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-25T18:32:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"box_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"insulated_b_24l\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"coolant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"phase_change_pack\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"packed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-25T09:05:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"initial_temp_c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"temp_at_delivery_c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"indicator_label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unchanged\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"open_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"elapsed_h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9.45</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>elapsed_h</code> 与 <code>temp_at_delivery_c</code> 的组合让后续可以做<strong>标定反馈</strong>：用真实配送数据反推 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 值，持续修正这个品类的配送时长模型。没有这个反馈回路，保温方案会一直停留在厂商标称值上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"无人在家的处理\">无人在家的处理</h3><p>配送失败是尾程超温的一大来源。传统做法是带回冷库重派，但这样一趟的代价高且货物已经历了一次完整的热循环。更优的做法是在末端设置<strong>带温控的暂存点</strong>：驿站或自提柜的冷藏格口，让货物在等待二次配送时不脱离温控。</p>\n<p>这项投入的经济性取决于该区域配送失败率的分布——高失败率的密集城区值得布置冷藏格口，低失败率的区域不值得。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[出库打包] --&gt; B[算可用时长]&#10;  B --&gt; C{路由时长 &lt; 可用时长?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[加冷媒/预冷/改期]&#10;  D --&gt; B&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[配送]&#10;  E --&gt; F{客户在家?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[当面签收+温度采集]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[冷藏暂存点]&#10;  H --&gt; I[二次配送]&#10;  I --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; J{温度合格?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[完成交付]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[进入定责/理赔流程]\">flowchart TD\n  A[出库打包] --&gt; B[算可用时长]\n  B --&gt; C{路由时长 &lt; 可用时长?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[加冷媒/预冷/改期]\n  D --&gt; B\n  C --&gt;|是| E[配送]\n  E --&gt; F{客户在家?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[当面签收+温度采集]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[冷藏暂存点]\n  H --&gt; I[二次配送]\n  I --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; J{温度合格?}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[完成交付]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[进入定责/理赔流程]</pre><h2 id=\"与本地冷库的协同\">与本地冷库的协同</h2><p>尾程的效率上限由<strong>销地冷库的出库能力</strong>决定。冷库的拣货速度、高峰期的月台排队、以及冷媒的准备能力（干冰需要现场制备或提前订购）都会传导到尾程时效。因此尾程与冷库不能分开优化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分时段出库</strong>：把出库时间与配送路线分批对齐，避免所有订单集中在早晨出库导致排队；</li>\n<li><strong>按温区并行拣货</strong>：不同温区的拣货作业并行，减少货在拣货区的停留；</li>\n<li><strong>冷媒预置</strong>：干冰与冰袋的用量按次日订单量提前备好，避免临时等货。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>出库之后如果发生超温引发的货损，进入定责与理赔流程，见 <a href=\"../coldchain-waste-ops/excursion-breach-liability-insurance\">断链定责与保险</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>尾程温度保障只能靠<strong>被动保温系统（容器 + 冷媒）</strong>，因此本质是一个<strong>时间预算问题</strong>。</li>\n<li>冷源三类：相变蓄冷（短途）、干冰（1–3 天，属危险品）、液氮（超长时，航空箱可达约 100 小时）。</li>\n<li>保温性能必须按季节与 P95/P99 配送时长实测标定，可参考 ISTA 7D/7E 的温控包装测试标准曲线。</li>\n<li>用一阶温升模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(t) = T_{env} - (T_{env}-T_0)e^{-kt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反解可用配送时长，作为打包与排班的硬约束。</li>\n<li>出库三个旋钮：初始温度（注意冷藏品不可过冷）、冷媒用量、路由与时效窗（成本最低）。</li>\n<li>减少开门次数、整箱交付、按紧迫度排序是三项最便宜的作业优化。</li>\n<li>签收要产生温度证据：一次性变色标签做现场判定，记录仪做定责，并用真实数据反推标定系数。</li>\n<li>配送失败用末端冷藏暂存点兜底；尾程效率上限由 <a href=\"local-cold-warehouse-turnover\">本地冷库出库能力</a> 决定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"本地冷库周转与冷链尾程保温","id":"本地冷库周转与冷链尾程保温"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"冷藏保温容器的选型","id":"冷藏保温容器的选型"},{"level":3,"text":"三种保温原理","id":"三种保温原理"},{"level":3,"text":"保温箱性能不是标称值，要实测","id":"保温箱性能不是标称值-要实测"},{"level":2,"text":"时间预算模型","id":"时间预算模型"},{"level":3,"text":"温升是可计算的","id":"温升是可计算的"},{"level":3,"text":"出库前的三个决策","id":"出库前的三个决策"},{"level":2,"text":"末端配送的作业控制","id":"末端配送的作业控制"},{"level":3,"text":"减少开门次数是最便宜的优化","id":"减少开门次数是最便宜的优化"},{"level":3,"text":"签收即验证","id":"签收即验证"},{"level":3,"text":"无人在家的处理","id":"无人在家的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"与本地冷库的协同","id":"与本地冷库的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"冷链快速清关/查验与温控不断链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/cold-customs-lastmile/cold-chain-fast-customs-inspection"},"next":{"title":"时效窗/预约与温控签收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/perishable-coldchain-temperature-fulfillment/cold-customs-lastmile/time-window-cold-proof-delivery"}}